(4353107, 626462, 82890, '<td valign="top">A little cropping would have done this some good (maybe removing the fence at the bottom) but the tree and the open sky look fantastic. Also, a deeper blue sky might have made the tree pop out a little more. Adjusting the color curves would probably give you that. I like the shot though, is it IR or just that snowy?</td>', 'A little cropping would have done this some good (maybe removing the fence at the bottom) but the tree and the open sky look fantastic. Also, a deeper blue sky might have made the tree pop out a little more. Adjusting the color curves would probably give you that. I like the shot though, is it IR or just that snowy?', '2008-01-02 08:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
