(4355183, 626226, 32872, '<td valign="top">omg....this takes my breath away it''s so stunningly beautiful!!  What a capture.  Your detail and lighting are perfect. The man is in the right spot too!!  Very COOL!!!!  This has to ribbon.</td>', 'omg....this takes my breath away it''s so stunningly beautiful!!  What a capture.  Your detail and lighting are perfect. The man is in the right spot too!!  Very COOL!!!!  This has to ribbon.', '2008-01-02 19:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
