(4355349, 626226, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is truly gorgeous ice. I like that you included a human element to show scale and the challenge of the climb. The darkness in the center gives a feeling that the climber has almost reached something. Amazing work! Perfect for the challenge.</td>', 'This is truly gorgeous ice. I like that you included a human element to show scale and the challenge of the climb. The darkness in the center gives a feeling that the climber has almost reached something. Amazing work! Perfect for the challenge.', '2008-01-02 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
