(4355361, 628349, 84736, '<td valign="top">nice capture, but the crop is not very good. the snowboarder has no head, and the pic would be much better if the shot included all of the boarder. also, a slightly faster shutter speed would have totally frozen the image. as it is, he is just a little fuzzy, most notibly in the coat. but the exposure is right on, and that is difficult with the white snow.</td>', 'nice capture, but the crop is not very good. the snowboarder has no head, and the pic would be much better if the shot included all of the boarder. also, a slightly faster shutter speed would have totally frozen the image. as it is, he is just a little fuzzy, most notibly in the coat. but the exposure is right on, and that is difficult with the white snow.', '2008-01-02 20:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355363, 626242, 85886, '<td valign="top">Overprocessed imho</td>', 'Overprocessed imho', '2008-01-02 20:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355365, 627414, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting and highly appropriate subject. I like that you show just enough of the paddle wheel without showing the whole thing. I like that your subject is something other than ice, but ice is clearly part of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting and highly appropriate subject. I like that you show just enough of the paddle wheel without showing the whole thing. I like that your subject is something other than ice, but ice is clearly part of the photo.', '2008-01-02 20:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355370, 628239, 88204, '<td valign="top">What a find! Very nice subject. I like how you achieved a monochromatic look with the white blurred background.</td>', 'What a find! Very nice subject. I like how you achieved a monochromatic look with the white blurred background.', '2008-01-02 20:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
