(4355383, 626695, 88204, '<td valign="top">If this was taken in the wild I''d give you extra credit! Nice photo but I''d like it better if the subject weren''t smack in the center of the frame. Also, it would have been nice to catch the bear looking at the camera. His/her gaze downward doesn''t add anything for me.</td>', 'If this was taken in the wild I''d give you extra credit! Nice photo but I''d like it better if the subject weren''t smack in the center of the frame. Also, it would have been nice to catch the bear looking at the camera. His/her gaze downward doesn''t add anything for me.', '2008-01-02 20:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355388, 627977, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color... is it natural? (I''ll assume so.) I can''t quite tell what this is so the main interest is the beautiful color, which isn''t quite enough for me.</td>', 'Beautiful color... is it natural? (I''ll assume so.) I can''t quite tell what this is so the main interest is the beautiful color, which isn''t quite enough for me.', '2008-01-02 20:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355394, 626927, 84736, '<td valign="top">i think a better way to do this shot would be to get lower to the ground, so that the bridge extends farther into the scene, the horizon gets pushed up out of the center of the frame, and the eye is lead through the entire shot, not the the first third. the exposure and color are great though.</td>', 'i think a better way to do this shot would be to get lower to the ground, so that the bridge extends farther into the scene, the horizon gets pushed up out of the center of the frame, and the eye is lead through the entire shot, not the the first third. the exposure and color are great though.', '2008-01-02 20:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355396, 628295, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes and lines. It''s a little too abstract for my tastes. I can''t tell if it''s a reflection or not. Nicely use of minimal color.</td>', 'Interesting shapes and lines. It''s a little too abstract for my tastes. I can''t tell if it''s a reflection or not. Nicely use of minimal color.', '2008-01-02 20:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355399, 628275, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful color and lighting.', '2008-01-02 20:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355404, 627120, 84736, '<td valign="top">this shot is interesting because it appears that the trail behind the cube is instantly freezing as the ice enters the water. great capture.</td>', 'this shot is interesting because it appears that the trail behind the cube is instantly freezing as the ice enters the water. great capture.', '2008-01-02 20:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355405, 628269, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is a very peaceful shot. I''d love to join you on the walk. The broken fence leaves me wondering what was in the pasture. I love the swirling clouds overhead... they bring some gentle turbulence to the peace.</td>', 'This is a very peaceful shot. I''d love to join you on the walk. The broken fence leaves me wondering what was in the pasture. I love the swirling clouds overhead... they bring some gentle turbulence to the peace.', '2008-01-02 20:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355408, 628028, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice location, nice smoothness to the water... I feel like it needs a little more of something for me to focus on other than just the falls.</td>', 'Nice location, nice smoothness to the water... I feel like it needs a little more of something for me to focus on other than just the falls.', '2008-01-02 20:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355412, 626968, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice color, I like the close framing of the subject... not sure why there are two colored cubes in the snow.</td>', 'Nice color, I like the close framing of the subject... not sure why there are two colored cubes in the snow.', '2008-01-02 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355416, 626412, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting ice formation! I like the white on top and the multicolor on the bottom. It''s a little abstract for my tastes.</td>', 'Interesting ice formation! I like the white on top and the multicolor on the bottom. It''s a little abstract for my tastes.', '2008-01-02 20:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355418, 628423, 84736, '<td valign="top">this shot is very cool. the way the ice crystals formed on that thorn are quite cool. nice find and good capture. also, the dof is amazing.</td>', 'this shot is very cool. the way the ice crystals formed on that thorn are quite cool. nice find and good capture. also, the dof is amazing.', '2008-01-02 20:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355420, 626545, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Where were you when you captured this? Including the person captures the scale of the mountain. I like that I can see the ice picks in the snow.</td>', 'Wow! Where were you when you captured this? Including the person captures the scale of the mountain. I like that I can see the ice picks in the snow.', '2008-01-02 20:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355422, 627939, 88204, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject but the lighting is too dark and underexposed for my tastes.</td>', 'Pretty subject but the lighting is too dark and underexposed for my tastes.', '2008-01-02 20:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355427, 627165, 88204, '<td valign="top">Looks a little like a snapshot. I would have liked a little something more... a closer crop on the face (give us a hint of the sled without the whole thing) or a pan to show movement or something.</td>', 'Looks a little like a snapshot. I would have liked a little something more... a closer crop on the face (give us a hint of the sled without the whole thing) or a pan to show movement or something.', '2008-01-02 20:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355430, 627703, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting deep colors in teh water. I like how you brought us right up the center of the frame (not sure if that was intentional framing or not but it works).</td>', 'Interesting deep colors in teh water. I like how you brought us right up the center of the frame (not sure if that was intentional framing or not but it works).', '2008-01-02 20:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355434, 627098, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting ice formation, nice monochrome image but doesn''t grab my attention.</td>', 'Interesting ice formation, nice monochrome image but doesn''t grab my attention.', '2008-01-02 20:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355438, 628427, 88204, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scene. Beautiful blue sky. What''s the red thing in the lower left? Seems like you should have cropped it in or out but not partial like you did. Is that a person at the top of the trail? I can''t see enough of them to spark my interest. I would have liked to see them mid-hill.</td>', 'Gorgeous scene. Beautiful blue sky. What''s the red thing in the lower left? Seems like you should have cropped it in or out but not partial like you did. Is that a person at the top of the trail? I can''t see enough of them to spark my interest. I would have liked to see them mid-hill.', '2008-01-02 20:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355444, 626108, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very nice, simple. I might like the leaf a little more off-center.</td>', 'Very nice, simple. I might like the leaf a little more off-center.', '2008-01-02 21:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355450, 628094, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of fire and ice. A little too literal for my tastes.</td>', 'Interesting combination of fire and ice. A little too literal for my tastes.', '2008-01-02 21:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355456, 626670, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, color and use of selective focus. The star is a nice focal point but I almost wish it wasn''t there to focus on the beauty of the needles.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, color and use of selective focus. The star is a nice focal point but I almost wish it wasn''t there to focus on the beauty of the needles.', '2008-01-02 21:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355503, 627176, 88204, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the textured ice and smooth water give an almost impressionistic feel. I like the use of minimal color. Very nice.</td>', 'The contrast of the textured ice and smooth water give an almost impressionistic feel. I like the use of minimal color. Very nice.', '2008-01-02 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355505, 628349, 88204, '<td valign="top">I would have like this better if I could see a facial expression or at least the full person, maybe off center in the frame. I think the subject is just the flying snow which isn''t all that exciting.</td>', 'I would have like this better if I could see a facial expression or at least the full person, maybe off center in the frame. I think the subject is just the flying snow which isn''t all that exciting.', '2008-01-02 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355506, 628319, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture and contrast between leaf and ice.</td>', 'Interesting texture and contrast between leaf and ice.', '2008-01-02 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355513, 628425, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I love the difference between the cool blue icey foreground and the warm trees in the background. YOu could have done more with the composition... get the person out of the smack dab center, show the person''s face, shift the perspective to a different angle.</td>', 'Great subject. I love the difference between the cool blue icey foreground and the warm trees in the background. YOu could have done more with the composition... get the person out of the smack dab center, show the person''s face, shift the perspective to a different angle.', '2008-01-02 21:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355516, 627692, 88204, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I don''t get the ice reference. Maybe I''m narrow minded. I like the shadow created by the structure and the trees. Nice foreground lighting. A graduated ND filter might have given the sky more definition.</td>', 'Hmmm... I don''t get the ice reference. Maybe I''m narrow minded. I like the shadow created by the structure and the trees. Nice foreground lighting. A graduated ND filter might have given the sky more definition.', '2008-01-02 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355519, 628310, 88204, '<td valign="top">Ooh... this looks COLD! Nice shot. I might have liked a closer crop on the wagon to highlight the bright color against the background. Maybe a lower angle too.</td>', 'Ooh... this looks COLD! Nice shot. I might have liked a closer crop on the wagon to highlight the bright color against the background. Maybe a lower angle too.', '2008-01-02 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355523, 628197, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a scene! Beautiful subject. Nice composition by putting the tree offcenter. Interesting lines in the picture. I like how the trees in the background fad out and there''s a hint of a silo, all shrouded by snowfall or fog or cold atmosphere. Minimal color emphasizes the simplicity of the beautiful scene.</td>', 'Wow! What a scene! Beautiful subject. Nice composition by putting the tree offcenter. Interesting lines in the picture. I like how the trees in the background fad out and there''s a hint of a silo, all shrouded by snowfall or fog or cold atmosphere. Minimal color emphasizes the simplicity of the beautiful scene.', '2008-01-02 21:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355525, 626242, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting splash. Looks highly processed, either contrast, saturation or sharpness. I like the blue light behind the glass. A bit contrived.</td>', 'Interesting splash. Looks highly processed, either contrast, saturation or sharpness. I like the blue light behind the glass. A bit contrived.', '2008-01-02 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355532, 628258, 88204, '<td valign="top">This one makes me happy... reminds me of many childhood pond hockey games. I like it that everyone is in "play" clothes and that the youngest boy''s tongue is out, showing he''s struggling to keep up with the big boys. I like it that your subject is people, not just ice. Maybe a closer crop to zoom in on the expressions, but then again you would have lost the feel of the threesome. Maybe a simpler background or out of focus background to simplify and focus on the expressions. Nicely done!</td>', 'This one makes me happy... reminds me of many childhood pond hockey games. I like it that everyone is in "play" clothes and that the youngest boy''s tongue is out, showing he''s struggling to keep up with the big boys. I like it that your subject is people, not just ice. Maybe a closer crop to zoom in on the expressions, but then again you would have lost the feel of the threesome. Maybe a simpler background or out of focus background to simplify and focus on the expressions. Nicely done!', '2008-01-02 21:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355544, 627791, 88204, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful scene. Where the heck is it? It looks like a beautiful and historic place (none of that in my neighborhood)! I like the coldness of the background with the warm foreground. The castle is a little too centered for me, maybe up and to the left just to offset. It seems a little blurred but maybe that''s my monitor.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful scene. Where the heck is it? It looks like a beautiful and historic place (none of that in my neighborhood)! I like the coldness of the background with the warm foreground. The castle is a little too centered for me, maybe up and to the left just to offset. It seems a little blurred but maybe that''s my monitor.', '2008-01-02 21:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355548, 627036, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like it that the subject is black and unlit while the background is lit... gives it twice the interest. Very nice lighting.</td>', 'I like it that the subject is black and unlit while the background is lit... gives it twice the interest. Very nice lighting.', '2008-01-02 21:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355560, 627257, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very creative interpretation of the theme. I''m not sure about the composition... did you mean to catch her eating with her tongue out or was this just a snapshot. How about a font and center composition highlighting some puffy cheeks with a wind angle, surrounded by the ice pack? That might have emphasized the wisdom teeth and the soreness that goes with it.</td>', 'Very creative interpretation of the theme. I''m not sure about the composition... did you mean to catch her eating with her tongue out or was this just a snapshot. How about a font and center composition highlighting some puffy cheeks with a wind angle, surrounded by the ice pack? That might have emphasized the wisdom teeth and the soreness that goes with it.', '2008-01-02 21:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355565, 627949, 88204, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite make out what this is and the pattern isn''t sharp enough to create interest. greens and pinks are interesting but not enough to make me want to ponder it.</td>', 'I can''t quite make out what this is and the pattern isn''t sharp enough to create interest. greens and pinks are interesting but not enough to make me want to ponder it.', '2008-01-02 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355568, 627613, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very interesting find. I love the bubbles. Nice use of contrasting colors. I like the center framing on this subject.</td>', 'Very interesting find. I love the bubbles. Nice use of contrasting colors. I like the center framing on this subject.', '2008-01-02 21:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355571, 628253, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but the lighting is much too dark for me. Would have been nice with strong backlighting or at least a bright light to catch the colors and reflect a sparkle.</td>', 'Interesting subject but the lighting is much too dark for me. Would have been nice with strong backlighting or at least a bright light to catch the colors and reflect a sparkle.', '2008-01-02 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355574, 627425, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly common type of shot but you executed it well. Great backlighting. Very interesting splash. I like the diagonal of the water.</td>', 'This is a fairly common type of shot but you executed it well. Great backlighting. Very interesting splash. I like the diagonal of the water.', '2008-01-02 21:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355576, 628309, 88204, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... doesn''t do it for me. Seems too contrived. I think that''s a ring but it doesn''t catch my attention.</td>', 'Hmmm... doesn''t do it for me. Seems too contrived. I think that''s a ring but it doesn''t catch my attention.', '2008-01-02 21:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355578, 628382, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and focus. Interesting texture. Somewhat literal interpretation of the theme but well executed.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and focus. Interesting texture. Somewhat literal interpretation of the theme but well executed.', '2008-01-02 21:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4355580, 627706, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Like the close cropping. Lighting leaves a little to be desired. I''d like to see a brighter light on the cherry.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Like the close cropping. Lighting leaves a little to be desired. I''d like to see a brighter light on the cherry.', '2008-01-02 21:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
