(4357099, 628239, 39679, '<td valign="top">Unlike most shots I see, B&amp;W really helps this photo.  I would be curious, though, to see it very desaturated so that the leaves were just barely colored...somewhat like the old watercolored bladk and whites.  I''m not sure that would make this photo any better (it''s already a really nice shot) but I''d be interested in how it worked.<br/> <br/>Great shot...it''s a pleasure judging it.</td>', 'Unlike most shots I see, B&W really helps this photo.  I would be curious, though, to see it very desaturated so that the leaves were just barely colored...somewhat like the old watercolored bladk and whites.  I''m not sure that would make this photo any better (it''s already a really nice shot) but I''d be interested in how it worked. Great shot...it''s a pleasure judging it.', '2008-01-03 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357109, 628295, 39679, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I''m having a hard time with the context of this shot.  That is, I certainly get the trees but the background makes it really hard for me to tell if I''m looking at a tree, shot at some strange angle, from above or if the background is just...well...odd.<br/> <br/>It''s a nice shot but without context (and it''s certainly not abstract) it''s hard for me to tell if I like it or not.  I hope this makes sense.</td>', 'I have to admit that I''m having a hard time with the context of this shot.  That is, I certainly get the trees but the background makes it really hard for me to tell if I''m looking at a tree, shot at some strange angle, from above or if the background is just...well...odd. It''s a nice shot but without context (and it''s certainly not abstract) it''s hard for me to tell if I like it or not.  I hope this makes sense.', '2008-01-03 10:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
