(4357137, 628042, 39679, '<td valign="top">What a cool subject (pun intended) but it looks like the composition is kind of haphazard.  I''d love to have seen this shot cropped tightly on just on of the ice formations.  It''s a hard thing to do to isolate your subject but well worth the work.</td>', 'What a cool subject (pun intended) but it looks like the composition is kind of haphazard.  I''d love to have seen this shot cropped tightly on just on of the ice formations.  It''s a hard thing to do to isolate your subject but well worth the work.', '2008-01-03 11:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4357183, 628309, 39679, '<td valign="top">To me, the concept of "ice on ice" would really have been driven home if the ring, particularly the center stone, would have been as shiny as possible.  There''s condensation on the ring which, to me, is distracting.</td>', 'To me, the concept of "ice on ice" would really have been driven home if the ring, particularly the center stone, would have been as shiny as possible.  There''s condensation on the ring which, to me, is distracting.', '2008-01-03 11:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
