(4357198, 626670, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice shot without the star.  The exposure, focus and contrast are outstanding and the grass(?) is a nice subject.  To me, the star just distracts from the rest of the (otherwise excellent) photo.</td>', 'This is such a nice shot without the star.  The exposure, focus and contrast are outstanding and the grass(?) is a nice subject.  To me, the star just distracts from the rest of the (otherwise excellent) photo.', '2008-01-03 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
