(4357210, 626411, 39679, '<td valign="top">This has a very Japanese feel...in it''s simplicity which I find very appealing.  Great job in finding a very nice shot in an "ordinary" subject.</td>', 'This has a very Japanese feel...in it''s simplicity which I find very appealing.  Great job in finding a very nice shot in an "ordinary" subject.', '2008-01-03 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
