(4358016, 626927, 87748, '<td valign="top">Good looking sky here; seems like it''s crafted with a paintbrush.  Obviously there are frozen spots here, but the wood is more showcased than the ice.  Good image, nonetheless.  I like how there is ice/snow in the shadows across the wood.</td>', 'Good looking sky here; seems like it''s crafted with a paintbrush.  Obviously there are frozen spots here, but the wood is more showcased than the ice.  Good image, nonetheless.  I like how there is ice/snow in the shadows across the wood.', '2008-01-03 16:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358017, 628248, 87748, '<td valign="top">Ice indeed.  A cold image with good composition.  The light comes off a little too bright on the fork.</td>', 'Ice indeed.  A cold image with good composition.  The light comes off a little too bright on the fork.', '2008-01-03 16:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358019, 627425, 87748, '<td valign="top">Simple, but it works.  Good focus on the subject.</td>', 'Simple, but it works.  Good focus on the subject.', '2008-01-03 16:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358020, 626968, 87748, '<td valign="top">A nice change from the harsh ice-on-white that tends to hurt my eyes.  Good use of colors here.  Maybe just a little underexposed.</td>', 'A nice change from the harsh ice-on-white that tends to hurt my eyes.  Good use of colors here.  Maybe just a little underexposed.', '2008-01-03 16:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358028, 627125, 87748, '<td valign="top">Contrast between the warm and cool colors here is great.  Nice DOF while still focusing sharply on the subject.  Only nag is that the top portion of the ice blends in too much with the white matter in the background.</td>', 'Contrast between the warm and cool colors here is great.  Nice DOF while still focusing sharply on the subject.  Only nag is that the top portion of the ice blends in too much with the white matter in the background.', '2008-01-03 16:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358031, 627414, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between emphasizing the ice and the mill structure (?).  Far background is a little distracting.  Good composition otherwise.</td>', 'Nice balance between emphasizing the ice and the mill structure (?).  Far background is a little distracting.  Good composition otherwise.', '2008-01-03 16:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358032, 626670, 87748, '<td valign="top">Great colors and focus here.  Background is a great compliment.  Exposure seems spot-on for me.</td>', 'Great colors and focus here.  Background is a great compliment.  Exposure seems spot-on for me.', '2008-01-03 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358034, 628266, 87748, '<td valign="top">Good smoothness to the melting (?) ice here.  Colors are generally good.</td>', 'Good smoothness to the melting (?) ice here.  Colors are generally good.', '2008-01-03 16:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358036, 628405, 87748, '<td valign="top">Image is a little busy and the utility lines across the image also distracting.  Colors are a little too uniform, and composition is just too straightforward.</td>', 'Image is a little busy and the utility lines across the image also distracting.  Colors are a little too uniform, and composition is just too straightforward.', '2008-01-03 16:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358040, 627361, 87748, '<td valign="top">Can''t find a focus in this image.  A little too much of the same thing here.  Color and subject contrast is missing.</td>', 'Can''t find a focus in this image.  A little too much of the same thing here.  Color and subject contrast is missing.', '2008-01-03 16:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358043, 627442, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice colors here.  Image is a little too soft (perhaps due to the ice covering the bud).  Good idea.</td>', 'Nice colors here.  Image is a little too soft (perhaps due to the ice covering the bud).  Good idea.', '2008-01-03 16:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358045, 627832, 87748, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness on the ice.  Wish there were more colors and a little more subject contrast here.</td>', 'Great sharpness on the ice.  Wish there were more colors and a little more subject contrast here.', '2008-01-03 16:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358051, 627833, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in the ice.  A creative title, too.  Ice isn''t a hard subject to introduce outside color into, but it also moves away from simply being ice.  However, I do wish there were more colors here.</td>', 'Nice texture in the ice.  A creative title, too.  Ice isn''t a hard subject to introduce outside color into, but it also moves away from simply being ice.  However, I do wish there were more colors here.', '2008-01-03 16:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358056, 628257, 87748, '<td valign="top">The sky here is presented more readily than the snow/ice.  Therefore, the lower portion of the image is a little too dark for my liking.  Too much going on in the form of irrelevant structures in the background, too.</td>', 'The sky here is presented more readily than the snow/ice.  Therefore, the lower portion of the image is a little too dark for my liking.  Too much going on in the form of irrelevant structures in the background, too.', '2008-01-03 16:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358059, 627817, 87748, '<td valign="top">I like the textures here.  However, composition seems a little too simple and focus is a little soft.</td>', 'I like the textures here.  However, composition seems a little too simple and focus is a little soft.', '2008-01-03 16:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358062, 628295, 87748, '<td valign="top">I have a hard time finding ice here (unless it is implied in the title in a non-literal way).  Nice colors and artistic use of differing light.</td>', 'I have a hard time finding ice here (unless it is implied in the title in a non-literal way).  Nice colors and artistic use of differing light.', '2008-01-03 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358064, 628174, 87748, '<td valign="top">Focus is overall too soft for me.  Interesting landscape even if it may be a little too crowded.  Lots of ice here!</td>', 'Focus is overall too soft for me.  Interesting landscape even if it may be a little too crowded.  Lots of ice here!', '2008-01-03 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358068, 628028, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice motion in the water.  There is a yellow cast on the ice, though, which is distracting (perhaps overexposed).  Pretty good composition otherwise.</td>', 'Nice motion in the water.  There is a yellow cast on the ice, though, which is distracting (perhaps overexposed).  Pretty good composition otherwise.', '2008-01-03 16:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358072, 627656, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice sky here and plenty of ice coverage.  Centered subject doesn''t seem to work in this case.  Would''ve liked the steeple/cross on the left allowing some of the landscape in the distance on the right to come into view.</td>', 'Nice sky here and plenty of ice coverage.  Centered subject doesn''t seem to work in this case.  Would''ve liked the steeple/cross on the left allowing some of the landscape in the distance on the right to come into view.', '2008-01-03 16:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358077, 627791, 87748, '<td valign="top">Too much haze in the background (where a lot of ice is).  Foreground is too distracting in color and in clarity.</td>', 'Too much haze in the background (where a lot of ice is).  Foreground is too distracting in color and in clarity.', '2008-01-03 16:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358080, 627854, 87748, '<td valign="top">Heh. :) Image is a little dark, and the blue Bawls is a little blurry.  Creative, though.</td>', 'Heh. :) Image is a little dark, and the blue Bawls is a little blurry.  Creative, though.', '2008-01-03 16:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358081, 627413, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, if simple.  Lighting is good here, but color is a little bland.  Texture in and on the ice comes through well.</td>', 'Nice composition, if simple.  Lighting is good here, but color is a little bland.  Texture in and on the ice comes through well.', '2008-01-03 16:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358082, 628090, 87748, '<td valign="top">Can''t find a focus here, and the subject is too overwhelming (filling the entire frame).  Not enough subject/scene contrast here.</td>', 'Can''t find a focus here, and the subject is too overwhelming (filling the entire frame).  Not enough subject/scene contrast here.', '2008-01-03 16:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
