(4358088, 627410, 87748, '<td valign="top">Good white balance and properly exposed.  Water flow is nice.  Scene is a little bland otherwise.  I do like how the water blends into the ice ins pots, though.</td>', 'Good white balance and properly exposed.  Water flow is nice.  Scene is a little bland otherwise.  I do like how the water blends into the ice ins pots, though.', '2008-01-03 16:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358091, 628039, 87748, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to be focused well.  I can see your idea but the composition isn''t quite what I would aim for.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to be focused well.  I can see your idea but the composition isn''t quite what I would aim for.', '2008-01-03 16:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358093, 628341, 87748, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Wish there was a sharper focus on the subject.</td>', 'Very nice.  Wish there was a sharper focus on the subject.', '2008-01-03 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358095, 627355, 87748, '<td valign="top">Plenty of ice here.  Flowing water is captured nicely.  Trees are a little distracting in spots (perhaps a different crop would''ve helped).</td>', 'Plenty of ice here.  Flowing water is captured nicely.  Trees are a little distracting in spots (perhaps a different crop would''ve helped).', '2008-01-03 16:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358098, 628115, 87539, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2008-01-03 16:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358101, 627770, 87748, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Overexposed in my opinion, but the whole composition here is abstract, so a correctly exposed image may not have been as good.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Overexposed in my opinion, but the whole composition here is abstract, so a correctly exposed image may not have been as good.', '2008-01-03 16:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358104, 628085, 87748, '<td valign="top">Texture and color in the counter is way too distracting.  The melting of the ice blends in too much with the counter.  A more neutral base for the ice and some control over the reflections in the ice would''ve helped.</td>', 'Texture and color in the counter is way too distracting.  The melting of the ice blends in too much with the counter.  A more neutral base for the ice and some control over the reflections in the ice would''ve helped.', '2008-01-03 16:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358108, 628172, 87748, '<td valign="top">The slope in the background and the falling snow is distracting.  Good subject here.</td>', 'The slope in the background and the falling snow is distracting.  Good subject here.', '2008-01-03 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358110, 628330, 87748, '<td valign="top">Way too dark for my liking.  It may be an ice storm, but it''s hard to tell just from headlights.</td>', 'Way too dark for my liking.  It may be an ice storm, but it''s hard to tell just from headlights.', '2008-01-03 16:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358111, 628450, 87748, '<td valign="top">Image is too small, therefore detail in the composition is hard to judge.  Seems a little underexposed.  Color here is good, but too simple.</td>', 'Image is too small, therefore detail in the composition is hard to judge.  Seems a little underexposed.  Color here is good, but too simple.', '2008-01-03 16:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358113, 627949, 87748, '<td valign="top">Colors are distracting.  I''m not sure if I need to focus on the white specks or the colored blobs.  Need a defined subject and some balance here.</td>', 'Colors are distracting.  I''m not sure if I need to focus on the white specks or the colored blobs.  Need a defined subject and some balance here.', '2008-01-03 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358114, 627199, 80588, '<td valign="top">Ooooooooh!!!!!!!!!!!! 8</td>', 'Ooooooooh!!!!!!!!!!!! 8', '2008-01-03 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358116, 627613, 80588, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.</td>', 'Very cool shot.', '2008-01-03 17:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358118, 626925, 87748, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, but the subject is too loosely defined (it fills the entire image with no focal point).  Bare branches aren''t highlighted or thrown into the background, so they feel a little distracting.</td>', 'Well exposed, but the subject is too loosely defined (it fills the entire image with no focal point).  Bare branches aren''t highlighted or thrown into the background, so they feel a little distracting.', '2008-01-03 17:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358119, 626649, 80588, '<td valign="top">Intense! Awesome!</td>', 'Intense! Awesome!', '2008-01-03 17:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358124, 628153, 87748, '<td valign="top">Image quality here leaves a lot to be desired.  Rockwork/branches are too distracting.  Seems to possibly be a color cast too.</td>', 'Image quality here leaves a lot to be desired.  Rockwork/branches are too distracting.  Seems to possibly be a color cast too.', '2008-01-03 17:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358128, 628290, 87748, '<td valign="top">Image contrast here seems to be off, and it''s overall too soft.  There is a distracting yellowish color cast due to the contrast, too.  Has the potential to be a great image if processed differently.</td>', 'Image contrast here seems to be off, and it''s overall too soft.  There is a distracting yellowish color cast due to the contrast, too.  Has the potential to be a great image if processed differently.', '2008-01-03 17:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358129, 627328, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is such a hoot!  Great capture, I may giggle all night!</td>', 'This is such a hoot!  Great capture, I may giggle all night!', '2008-01-03 17:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358137, 628099, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is too funny for words,  Nicely captured.</td>', 'This is too funny for words,  Nicely captured.', '2008-01-03 17:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358213, 627522, 78652, '<td valign="top">I actually feel some empathy for this bee...very nice photo.</td>', 'I actually feel some empathy for this bee...very nice photo.', '2008-01-03 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358219, 627125, 78652, '<td valign="top">I love the warm colors contrasted with the ice on the leaf.</td>', 'I love the warm colors contrasted with the ice on the leaf.', '2008-01-03 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358227, 626478, 78652, '<td valign="top">It''s like looking at a postcard.  Nice shot.</td>', 'It''s like looking at a postcard.  Nice shot.', '2008-01-03 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358233, 626226, 78652, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Especially like how the climber provides a reference on the scale of the face.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Especially like how the climber provides a reference on the scale of the face.', '2008-01-03 17:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4358256, 628146, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot with nice DOF.  Can''t decide if the blue cast to the snow enhances or detracts.</td>', 'Pretty shot with nice DOF.  Can''t decide if the blue cast to the snow enhances or detracts.', '2008-01-03 17:48:14.000000', NULL, 1);
