(4358548, 626462, 84736, '<td valign="top">first thought is the fences are very distracting. a tighter crop would take those away. another perspective might have been to focus on just one bunch of branches against the blue sky. sometimes a minimalistic approach makes for a stronger picture.</td>', 'first thought is the fences are very distracting. a tighter crop would take those away. another perspective might have been to focus on just one bunch of branches against the blue sky. sometimes a minimalistic approach makes for a stronger picture.', '2008-01-03 20:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
