(4361806, 628085, 74979, '<td valign="top">nice effect of the ice melting on the stone...could have found this outside.  NIce composition too</td>', 'nice effect of the ice melting on the stone...could have found this outside.  NIce composition too', '2008-01-04 21:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4361808, 627114, 62318, '<td valign="top">No vote from me, as I''m not sure if the feet are the "frozen" part. I look at it some more and it seems that the candle is frozen around the edges. That''s pretty neat, is that the Ice part? Not sure. Then you have fire. Not sure if it is in the right challenge. I''m guessing it is. Ah I''ll give you a six as now I am utterly confused. Cheers<br/> <br/>One thing I might try though is a square crop. Might bring a bit more tension to the photo.</td>', 'No vote from me, as I''m not sure if the feet are the "frozen" part. I look at it some more and it seems that the candle is frozen around the edges. That''s pretty neat, is that the Ice part? Not sure. Then you have fire. Not sure if it is in the right challenge. I''m guessing it is. Ah I''ll give you a six as now I am utterly confused. Cheers One thing I might try though is a square crop. Might bring a bit more tension to the photo.', '2008-01-04 21:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
