(4362019, 628455, 83313, '<td valign="top">Eerie looking. Don''t know what i am looking at, but I like it. Was it shot through a piece of ice? I hope you''ll put an explanation of what this is and how it was done in the notes for this pic.</td>', 'Eerie looking. Don''t know what i am looking at, but I like it. Was it shot through a piece of ice? I hope you''ll put an explanation of what this is and how it was done in the notes for this pic.', '2008-01-04 23:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
