(4362037, 628201, 83313, '<td valign="top">Incredibly clear and sharp, almost to the point of being oversharp. I love the little sparkles of light. This is one that I would love to see the high res copy of.</td>', 'Incredibly clear and sharp, almost to the point of being oversharp. I love the little sparkles of light. This is one that I would love to see the high res copy of.', '2008-01-04 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
