(4364494, 628236, 68947, '<td valign="top">looks delicious.....a bit too much of a "snapshot" look to it though???  Wondering if perhaps, having taken a different angle to this might have made a difference?  Perhaps by having your model''s face closer to the ice cream dish and perhaps, zooming in on just her eyes above the ice cream might have given it more of a "professional" look as opposed to snapshot look????  Just my 2 cents worth.  Nothing more.</td>', 'looks delicious.....a bit too much of a "snapshot" look to it though???  Wondering if perhaps, having taken a different angle to this might have made a difference?  Perhaps by having your model''s face closer to the ice cream dish and perhaps, zooming in on just her eyes above the ice cream might have given it more of a "professional" look as opposed to snapshot look????  Just my 2 cents worth.  Nothing more.', '2008-01-05 20:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364495, 628197, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I like the brown tone, very rustic feeling.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I like the brown tone, very rustic feeling.', '2008-01-05 20:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364497, 628257, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow good perspective.  I love the details you captured in this shot.  The tones are great.</td>', 'Wow good perspective.  I love the details you captured in this shot.  The tones are great.', '2008-01-05 20:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364501, 626462, 41802, '<td valign="top">I like the tree.  I might have cropped the shot down to leave out all the extras so we can just focus on the tree.  The frost has a good contrast against that blue sky.</td>', 'I like the tree.  I might have cropped the shot down to leave out all the extras so we can just focus on the tree.  The frost has a good contrast against that blue sky.', '2008-01-05 20:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
