(4364518, 628295, 41802, '<td valign="top">I really like how vintage this shot is, it grabs your attention.  Nice job using the shadows.</td>', 'I really like how vintage this shot is, it grabs your attention.  Nice job using the shadows.', '2008-01-05 21:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364519, 627888, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely white on white capture!  Just wish that the border had have been left off or a think black one.  The red border kind of distracts from the shot''s loveliness.  Still.....great shot!  I like it!</td>', 'Lovely white on white capture!  Just wish that the border had have been left off or a think black one.  The red border kind of distracts from the shot''s loveliness.  Still.....great shot!  I like it!', '2008-01-05 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
