(4364525, 628331, 41802, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the winter and the fresh grass underneath.</td>', 'Great contrast between the winter and the fresh grass underneath.', '2008-01-05 21:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364528, 628128, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow I can''t wait to see how you took this shot, it really is prefect.</td>', 'Wow I can''t wait to see how you took this shot, it really is prefect.', '2008-01-05 21:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364529, 626411, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oh wow......now this shot is so simplistic, but somehow, the play of shadow and light, the loneliness of this dying branch, it''s bent over, broken positioning, somehow just captures a mood that really says something!!!  Almost makes me want to cry.  You''ve evoked an emotion in me and THAT is worth more than all of the "brilliant studio shots" all combined!  9 from me!!!!  Please don''t let others tell you that this isn''t a great shot!  LOVE IT!!!!  It''s a picture that''s worth a thousand words!!!  (Hey, I vote differently than most in here who will vote high on the esthetically and technically pleasing studio shots!!! :))</td>', 'Oh wow......now this shot is so simplistic, but somehow, the play of shadow and light, the loneliness of this dying branch, it''s bent over, broken positioning, somehow just captures a mood that really says something!!!  Almost makes me want to cry.  You''ve evoked an emotion in me and THAT is worth more than all of the "brilliant studio shots" all combined!  9 from me!!!!  Please don''t let others tell you that this isn''t a great shot!  LOVE IT!!!!  It''s a picture that''s worth a thousand words!!!  (Hey, I vote differently than most in here who will vote high on the esthetically and technically pleasing studio shots!!! :))', '2008-01-05 21:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364530, 628307, 41802, '<td valign="top">Nice job, it really feels so cold.  Nice job!</td>', 'Nice job, it really feels so cold.  Nice job!', '2008-01-05 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4364535, 628453, 68947, '<td valign="top">ohhhh....bet you''re taking flack for the "uneven/tilted" glass in this one!??? *smile*  I had to take so much flack for a couple of my shots where the cup/glass or whatever wasn''t "level".  Certainly, this shows "ice"!</td>', 'ohhhh....bet you''re taking flack for the "uneven/tilted" glass in this one!??? *smile*  I had to take so much flack for a couple of my shots where the cup/glass or whatever wasn''t "level".  Certainly, this shows "ice"!', '2008-01-05 21:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
