(4364890, 628290, 43031, '<td valign="top">a few problems here. not sure why the slight brown tones are there, but they don''t really work, and a vintage look is not at all in context here. you set the compression way to hight when you saved the file for web, creating blocky .jpg artifacts that are really distracting. the models pose comes up short, since she''s not posed at all, really. There''s no intentionality with this setup at all, besides the feat of getting the model to sit on a cold log in the snow in the first place anyways.</td>', 'a few problems here. not sure why the slight brown tones are there, but they don''t really work, and a vintage look is not at all in context here. you set the compression way to hight when you saved the file for web, creating blocky .jpg artifacts that are really distracting. the models pose comes up short, since she''s not posed at all, really. There''s no intentionality with this setup at all, besides the feat of getting the model to sit on a cold log in the snow in the first place anyways.', '2008-01-05 23:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
