(4376855, 628439, 53147, '<td valign="top">The general colors are pleasing, but the abstract nature of it isn''t. Its a bit on the dark side with no real flowing or purposeful composition. It just feels like a jumbled mess. I think its very possible that your third outatke would have scored better as its a generally cleaner image with more distinct shapes.</td>', 'The general colors are pleasing, but the abstract nature of it isn''t. Its a bit on the dark side with no real flowing or purposeful composition. It just feels like a jumbled mess. I think its very possible that your third outatke would have scored better as its a generally cleaner image with more distinct shapes.', '2008-01-09 07:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
