(4376886, 628172, 83313, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote on this one, but it''s a really interesting shot. Looks like you were keeping an eye out and snapped a keeper while you could get it. About my only critique is that the steeply angled roofline seems at odds with the rest of the picture. I would have likely given it a 6, or maybe a 7 for it''s uniqueness.</td>', 'I didn''t vote on this one, but it''s a really interesting shot. Looks like you were keeping an eye out and snapped a keeper while you could get it. About my only critique is that the steeply angled roofline seems at odds with the rest of the picture. I would have likely given it a 6, or maybe a 7 for it''s uniqueness.', '2008-01-09 08:15:33.000000', NULL, 0),
