(4376904, 628315, 15832, '<td valign="top">Once again.... Congrats with this stunning image.. :)</td>', 'Once again.... Congrats with this stunning image.. :)', '2008-01-09 08:27:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4376907, 627692, 83313, '<td valign="top">This probably got scored so low because of the lack of visible ice. Seems like a shoehorn attempt. It''s not a bad pic, though. Aside from not meeting the challenge theme, I would have probably given it a 5. I can see an effort at composing an interesting shot of a good scene. My eye flows up the path and to the bridge quite nicely. Clarity and sharpness seems lacking a bit, especially on that nice stonework on the bridge. Some curves adjustment and sharpening would have probably helped that.<br/> <br/>To play JPEG police for a moment, your file size is only 89k. With up to 150k available, you may have been able to reduce the compression level and gotten a touch more detail into the entry. Also, the method used for resizing often has a serious effect on how much detail there is in the final product.</td>', 'This probably got scored so low because of the lack of visible ice. Seems like a shoehorn attempt. It''s not a bad pic, though. Aside from not meeting the challenge theme, I would have probably given it a 5. I can see an effort at composing an interesting shot of a good scene. My eye flows up the path and to the bridge quite nicely. Clarity and sharpness seems lacking a bit, especially on that nice stonework on the bridge. Some curves adjustment and sharpening would have probably helped that. To play JPEG police for a moment, your file size is only 89k. With up to 150k available, you may have been able to reduce the compression level and gotten a touch more detail into the entry. Also, the method used for resizing often has a serious effect on how much detail there is in the final product.', '2008-01-09 08:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4376920, 627114, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hey, a brown ribbon is sort of an achievement! I''ve actually TRIED to get a brown and failed! Nowhere to go from here but up, man!</td>', 'Hey, a brown ribbon is sort of an achievement! I''ve actually TRIED to get a brown and failed! Nowhere to go from here but up, man!', '2008-01-09 08:34:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4376922, 628128, 48228, '<td valign="top">This should have scored so much better..... Differant from the rest and done extreamly well..... Love the fluro rainbow colors..... Love to know how you did this..... Adding to my favorites.....</td>', 'This should have scored so much better..... Differant from the rest and done extreamly well..... Love the fluro rainbow colors..... Love to know how you did this..... Adding to my favorites.....', '2008-01-09 08:36:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4376942, 626649, 47906, '<td valign="top">Peter, <br/> <br/>Congrats on the score, a 2nd PB and the excellent image. I love the detail and the sharpness of the final edit. Very nicely done. This will look nice on your front page.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-01-09 08:50:13.</i></td>', 'Peter,  Congrats on the score, a 2nd PB and the excellent image. I love the detail and the sharpness of the final edit. Very nicely done. This will look nice on your front page.', '2008-01-09 08:48:37.000000', '2008-01-09 08:50:13.000000', 0),
(4377011, 626649, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo, Peter, another HM to add to your growing collection! What a fantastic photo this is. That background lighting is absolutely stunning. Almost looks like the icicle is in a studio it is so well lit. You are really kicking my butt lately but couldn''t be happier to see you producing such fine work :-)</td>', 'Woo hoo, Peter, another HM to add to your growing collection! What a fantastic photo this is. That background lighting is absolutely stunning. Almost looks like the icicle is in a studio it is so well lit. You are really kicking my butt lately but couldn''t be happier to see you producing such fine work :-)', '2008-01-09 09:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
