(4377281, 628319, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6 because I liked the moment you captured and the beautiful contrast in colors.  I think I did not give it a higher score because my taste leans towards wanting to see subjects in focus.  The leaves were the first ting to capture my attention and I would have liked to have seen them be a little sharper or clearer to make them stand apart from the ice.</td>', 'I gave it a 6 because I liked the moment you captured and the beautiful contrast in colors.  I think I did not give it a higher score because my taste leans towards wanting to see subjects in focus.  The leaves were the first ting to capture my attention and I would have liked to have seen them be a little sharper or clearer to make them stand apart from the ice.', '2008-01-09 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377287, 628028, 6534, '<td valign="top">Wow, thanks very much!!! :)  I honestly didn''t know what to expect, it was my first round of pics with the SLR.  I drove to the falls just to snap the picture.  Didn''t expect to make it into the top 10, so this is certainly encouraging.  Thanks everyone who voted!</td>', 'Wow, thanks very much!!! :)  I honestly didn''t know what to expect, it was my first round of pics with the SLR.  I drove to the falls just to snap the picture.  Didn''t expect to make it into the top 10, so this is certainly encouraging.  Thanks everyone who voted!', '2008-01-09 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377300, 626226, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a totally amazing shot.  With the guy there doing his thing and then all of the hanging ice.  I can only imagine that this must be spectacular to see in person.  I expected this to win the blue... but congrats on the Red!</td>', 'I thought this was a totally amazing shot.  With the guy there doing his thing and then all of the hanging ice.  I can only imagine that this must be spectacular to see in person.  I expected this to win the blue... but congrats on the Red!', '2008-01-09 10:45:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377306, 627328, 70661, '<td valign="top">I love this! You got a 10 from me!</td>', 'I love this! You got a 10 from me!', '2008-01-09 10:46:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377367, 627317, 54778, '<td valign="top">Simpler shots need to be absolutely perfect to get any merit with the dpc crowd.. The composition seems kind of tight.. so more negative space would be good.. and light definitely too dull.. if you don''t have any great light sources take things outside.. I can see the dof is actually shallow and not out of focus as it may seem the first time around but the light doesn''t allow us to view it in full glory.. and I don''t like the background colour.. takes away prominence away from the subject..</td>', 'Simpler shots need to be absolutely perfect to get any merit with the dpc crowd.. The composition seems kind of tight.. so more negative space would be good.. and light definitely too dull.. if you don''t have any great light sources take things outside.. I can see the dof is actually shallow and not out of focus as it may seem the first time around but the light doesn''t allow us to view it in full glory.. and I don''t like the background colour.. takes away prominence away from the subject..', '2008-01-09 11:05:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377370, 626670, 50034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  This truly is an excellent photo!  :)</td>', 'Congratulations!  This truly is an excellent photo!  :)', '2008-01-09 11:06:20.000000', NULL, 0),
