(4387045, 628315, 80096, '<td valign="top">The falls is totally out of focus and the ice is over sharpened. <br/> <br/>This would have been a nice composition had you concentrated more on one specific area. The sky is nice but it doesn''t fit the rest of the composition. Perhaps a 15 sec shutter would have worked better. <br/> <br/>I''m surprised this took first place.</td>', 'The falls is totally out of focus and the ice is over sharpened.  This would have been a nice composition had you concentrated more on one specific area. The sky is nice but it doesn''t fit the rest of the composition. Perhaps a 15 sec shutter would have worked better.  I''m surprised this took first place.', '2008-01-12 13:34:43.000000', NULL, 0),
