(4593709, 627120, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good splash in the water shot.  The only problem with using an ice cube is it doesn''t stand out against the background well enough.  Hence the use of lemons and such against contrasting backgrounds.  Sounds like you had fun doing it, and now that you know how, you can do it whenever it suits!</td>', 'A good splash in the water shot.  The only problem with using an ice cube is it doesn''t stand out against the background well enough.  Hence the use of lemons and such against contrasting backgrounds.  Sounds like you had fun doing it, and now that you know how, you can do it whenever it suits!', '2008-03-28 13:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
